# The client currently needs no environment variables — the dev server
# proxies /api to the Express backend via client/vite.config.js, and there
# are no client-side secrets. This file exists so the convention (copy
# .env.example to .env in both /server and /client) holds for both halves
# of the app, and so any future VITE_-prefixed variables have an obvious
# place to be documented.
